Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2.4. V4: both mixed bubbles", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"c0d5f212-4af8-40cc-8d5c-683eeffba121"],

Cell["FeynArts supplies both scalar-leg attachments. Their scalar loop momentum is l and their graviton momentum is p1 − l or p2 − l. The changes of integration variable l -> p1 − l and l -> p2 − l recover the previous graviton-loop-momentum routings. Both have unit weight. Sum the two native integrands once; do not add another exchanged copy.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"73cc63f5-5a9d-487f-8ce7-8901f6f1a28a"],

